 here the survey is in English and anyone can take part; (7) the photographs are the figure copies (about 456-576 px wide).\",\n  \"locale\": \"en\",\n  \"mediaFolders\": [\n   \"photos\"\n  ],\n  \"pages\": [\n   {\n    \"name\": \"start\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"consent\",\n      \"name\": \"consent\",\n      \"title\": \"I agree to take part. Participation is voluntary and my answers are recorded anonymously for research.\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"labelTrue\": \"I agree\",\n      \"labelFalse\": \"I do not agree\"\n     }\n    ]\n   },\n   {\n    \"name\": \"photos\",\n    \"elements\": [\n     {\n      \"type\": \"comment\",\n      \"name\": \"impression\",\n      \"title\": \"What are your first impressions on looking at this photograph?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Question I, open answer. Keyed by image id.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"matrix\",\n      \"name\": \"assess\",\n      \"title\": \"How do you assess this picture?\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"rows\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": \"attractive\",\n        \"text\": \"Attractive\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"spruce\",\n        \"text\": \"Spruce (e.g., horticultural, proper and tidy maintenance)\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": \"enriching\",\n        \"text\": \"Enriching (e.g., educational, functional, social benefits) for urban areas\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"columns\": [\n       {\n        \"value\": 1,\n        \"text\": \"1\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 2,\n        \"text\": \"2\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 3,\n        \"text\": \"3\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 4,\n        \"text\": \"4\"\n       },\n       {\n        \"value\": 5,\n        \"text\": \"5\"\n       }\n      ],\n      \"description\": \"Question II, five-level Likert items, 1 = not at all to 5 = very much (labels ours). Keyed by image id.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"typ